            "Text": "Bu eğitimi dış görünümde gerçekleştiremezsiniz.",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "zh-CN": {
            "Text": "你不能以外部视角执行此培训。",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          }
        }
      },
      "b2ba956f-f763-4547-8799-f845c5103a33": {
        "Name": "AttitudesPitch.Dlg_IntroAlternative2",
        "Comment": "VO TTS aviation instruction",
        "Speaker": "INSTRUCTOR",
        "LastModifiedBy": "pzochalves",
        "LastModifiedDate": "2024-09-06 16:33:45",
        "LocalizationStatus": "Active",
        "Languages": {
          "de-DE": {
            "Text": "Sehen Sie, wie die mittlere Linie dem Horizont entspricht, wenn wir horizontal fliegen?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "Text": "Notice how the middle line matches the horizon while we're flying level?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationNeeded"
          },
          "es-ES": {
            "Text": "¿Te das cuenta de que la línea central coincide con el horizonte mientras volamos?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "es-MX": {
            "Text": "¿Te das cuenta de que la línea central coincide con el horizonte mientras volamos?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "fi-FI": {
            "Text": "Huomaatko, miten keskilinja vastaa horisonttia, kun lennämme vaakatasossa?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "fr-FR": {
            "Text": "Vous voyez comme celui du milieu s'aligne sur l'horizon ?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "it-IT": {
            "Text": "Vedi che la linea in mezzo corrisponde all'orizzonte mentre voliamo?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "ja-JP": {
            "Text": "水平飛行中は真ん中の線と地平線が一致していますね?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "ko-KR": {
            "Text": "수평 비행 시 가운데 선이 지평선과 일치하는 게 보이죠?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "nb-NO": {
            "Text": "Ser du hvordan midtlinjen samsvarer med horisonten når vi flyr rett?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "nl-NL": {
            "Text": "Zie je hoe de middelste lijn overeenkomt met de horizon terwijl we recht vliegen?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "pl-PL": {
            "Text": "Widzisz, że w locie poziomym środkowa linia pokrywa się z horyzontem?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "pt-BR": {
            "Text": "Notou como a linha do meio corresponde ao horizonte quando voamos nivelados?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "pt-PT": {
            "Text": "Notou como a linha do meio corresponde ao horizonte quando voamos nivelados?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "ru-RU": {
            "Text": "Смотрите: в горизонтальном полёте линия посередине совпадает с линией горизонта.",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "sv-SE": {
            "Text": "Ser du att mittlinjen ligger vid horisonten när vi flyger i våg?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "tr-TR": {
            "Text": "Düz uçtuğumuzda ortadaki çizginin ufukla tam uyuştuğunu fark ettiniz mi?",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          },
          "zh-CN": {
            "Text": "注意当我们水平飞行时，中线是如何与地平线重合的。",
            "LocalizationStatus": "TranslationOk"
          }
        }
      },
